= Drill 7: Writing 2 — Viết lại câu Đồng nghĩa Tự luận (16 câu | Vận dụng)

*Rewrite each of the following sentences in such a way that it means almost the same as the sentence printed before it.*

+ Volunteers collect plastic bottles along Vinh River every Sunday morning.\
  → *Plastic bottles* #tline.
+ The Youth Union will organize a green lifestyle exhibition next Friday.\
  → *A green lifestyle exhibition* #tline.
+ Local artisans made these moon-shaped lutes by hand fifty years ago.\
  → *These moon-shaped lutes* #tline.
+ People should turn off electrical appliances before leaving the house.\
  → *Electrical appliances* #tline.
+ They are going to build a new solar power station in this district next year.\
  → *A new solar power station* #tline.
+ Workers are planting two hundred shade trees around the city stadium right now.\
  → *Two hundred shade trees* #tline.
+ Because the lead singer had a sore throat, the band postponed the live show. *(Use #strong[so])*\
  → *The lead singer* #tline.
+ Although folk music is centuries old, many teenagers still enjoy its melodies. *(Use #strong[but])*\
  → *Folk music* #tline.
+ You must reserve your concert ticket today; otherwise, all seats will be sold out. *(Use #strong[or])*\
  → *You must* #tline.
+ Nam loves helping his mother cook dinner. He also enjoys doing the gardening. *(Use #strong[and])*\
  → *Nam loves* #tline.
+ My parents don't allow me to use my smartphone during family meals. *(Use #strong[let])*\
  → *My parents don't* #tline.
+ Our parents let us choose our favorite musical instrument at school. *(Use #strong[allowed])*\
  → *We are* #tline.
+ The music teacher made the choir practice the chorus three more times. *(Passive voice)*\
  → *The choir* #tline.
+ Our class plans to launch a "No Plastic Straws" campaign next Monday. *(Use #strong[going to])*\
  → *Our class is* #tline.
+ My mother spends forty-five minutes preparing breakfast for our family every day.\
  → *It takes* #tline.
+ Nobody told me about the change in the concert schedule yesterday. *(Passive voice)*\
  → *I* #tline.
